|---|---:|
| median | **0.9%** |
| mean | 2.3% |
| p90 | 5.5% |
| above 5% of EV | 33 of 291 |
| above 10% of EV | **12 of 291** |
| above 20% of EV | 4 of 291 |
| maximum | **35.2%** — JD.L, **place 5**, and in PIPELINE |

**It is concentrated, and in two sectors:**

